node_modules/
__pycache__/

# local dogfooding artifacts — but the living spec store apriori/specs/ IS tracked,
# including NEW files (apriori/* + negation, so new store modules are never silently ignored).
# apriori/changes/ is ALSO tracked: the suite's corpus oracles (ARR-03, RL-40, RL-41) replay
# this repository's own review corpus — it is a test dependency, so it ships with the clone
# (P3 acceptance: an as-delivered `git archive` copy must reproduce the full green suite).
apriori/*
!apriori/specs/
!apriori/changes/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
# frozen dogfood labs keep their pre-4.0 layouts locally
validation/**/requirement/
validation/**/spike/
